      "narration": [
        "The fix: during training, a second agent plays the harness.",
        {
          "who": "asker",
          "say": "Wait, who's the second agent?",
          "kind": "question"
        },
        "Picture it: you're the student model. You propose your next step.",
        "I'm the harnessing agent. I review it, using the harness's rules.",
        "Sound steps pass unchanged.",
        "Weak ones get the smallest fix.",
        "The plain harness runs it.",
        "The result joins your own history."
